---
description: Android and Gradle development rules
globs:
  - "**/*.kt"
  - "**/*.kts"
  - "**/build.gradle"
  - "**/build.gradle.kts"
alwaysApply: false
---

Before introducing a dependency, verify whether the repository already
contains an equivalent dependency.

Do not upgrade Gradle, AGP, Kotlin, Java, Android SDK, or dependencies
unless explicitly required.

Use existing build conventions.

Prefer compiling the smallest affected module before attempting a
full repository build.

For Kotlin changes:
- preserve null-safety
- follow existing coroutine patterns
- reuse dependency injection conventions
- avoid unnecessary allocation in frequently executed paths

Never suppress compiler warnings merely to make a build pass unless the
reason is understood and justified.
